Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.44,0:00:05.74,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,I, Maria Annovazzi, also known as Mimi, \Nwas raised to be my family's heir
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.74,0:00:08.86,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,until my younger brother was born \Nand I was freed from that responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.86,0:00:13.78,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,However, despite reaching marriageable \Nage, I still haven't found a partner,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.78,0:00:15.79,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,so I reached out to my distant \Nrelatives in the Ametis family
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.79,0:00:18.50,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,to study abroad in \Nthe Kingdom of Rubini, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.50,0:00:22.38,flashback,RENATO,0,0,0,,I, Renato di Rubini, first prince \Nof the Kingdom of Rubini,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.38,0:00:26.38,flashback,RENATO,0,0,0,,hereby call off our engagement.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.22,0:00:34.56,flashback,MIMI,0,0,0,,The first thing you should do is...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.56,0:00:36.71,flashback,MIMI,0,0,0,,buy some glasses!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.52,0:00:43.63,flashback,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,Your Grace!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.63,0:00:44.34,flashback,AIDA,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.34,0:00:45.20,flashback,MOB,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.20,0:00:46.10,flashback,MOB,0,0,0,,Someone call a doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.10,0:00:47.04,flashback,MOB,0,0,0,,Your Grace!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.28,0:01:08.54,sign_Georgia,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFEFEFD&\an8\fs40\c&H1B1A20&\shad0\bord4\fad(1782,1)}Always a {\c&H8971F4&}Catch!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.99,0:02:23.00,sign_Georgia,EPTITLE,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,65)\c&H141722&\bord4\shad0\fs27\3c&HF4F3FC&}Episode 2
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.99,0:02:23.00,sign_Georgia,EPTITLE,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(319,260)\fs22\c&H080600&\bord0\shad0}How I {\c&HD49E5B&}Caught {\c&H080600&}the One That Got Away
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.02,0:02:27.33,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,That was some party.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.33,0:02:30.00,flashback,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,I'm terribly sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.00,0:02:33.74,flashback,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,As Prince Renato's aide, \NI offer my deepest apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.74,0:02:38.66,flashback,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,Duke Ametis has been sent home \Nwith the royal physician.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.66,0:02:41.52,flashback,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry for hurting you both.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.52,0:02:44.64,flashback,MIMI,0,0,0,,You don't have to apologize so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.64,0:02:45.60,flashback,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.64,0:02:45.60,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.83,0:02:53.11,flashback,RENATO,0,0,0,,I-I am terribly sorry \Nabout what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.11,0:02:57.66,flashback,MIMI,0,0,0,,If you're sorry, then \Nthat's good enough for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.66,0:03:02.86,flashback,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,No, please let us offer \Nan official apology at a later date.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.52,0:03:06.17,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I have no idea what's going on anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.17,0:03:13.00,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Don't say that. Prince Renato \Nreally is sorry for what he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.48,0:03:14.79,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Besides...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.76,0:03:20.07,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,This incident could postpone him \Nbeing made crown prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.07,0:03:22.02,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Aida?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.02,0:03:26.95,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Weren't you supposed to officially \Nannounce your engagement today?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.70,0:03:35.11,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Prince Renato never wanted to get \Nengaged to me in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.11,0:03:36.11,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.53,0:03:41.76,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,To be honest, I was expecting him \Nto call it off eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.76,0:03:43.37,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,So don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.37,0:03:45.28,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,He didn't want to?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.28,0:03:48.75,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,That's still not a reason to have \Nthat conversation at that party.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.75,0:03:56.63,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H5450C8&\3c&HFFFCFF&}BONK BONK BONK
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.75,0:03:52.84,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,And you never bullied Eleonora \Nor whatever her name is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.84,0:03:56.58,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I know better than anyone \Nthat you'd never do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.58,0:03:59.26,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,And who confuses another \Ngirl for his fiancée?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.96,0:04:02.66,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,We hardly ever saw each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.66,0:04:06.45,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,So he doesn't remember what \Nyou look like? Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.41,0:04:08.67,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,But Mimi...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.91,0:04:12.74,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Don't blame Prince Renato too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.74,0:04:16.10,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,He's a very intelligent \Nand thoughtful person.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.10,0:04:20.82,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Intelligent? \NI won't if you don't want me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.82,0:04:21.91,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.91,0:04:24.33,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Anyway, I'm more worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.33,0:04:25.49,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.49,0:04:29.01,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,You attracted a lot of odd attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.01,0:04:33.13,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,I hope it won't interfere \Nwith finding a promising catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.38,0:04:50.77,sign_Verdana,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H7A3662&\3c&HFFFFFF&\shad0\blur4}That's Right
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.38,0:04:41.07,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,That's right. I'm here to find a spouse \Nbecause I got no attention back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.07,0:04:44.73,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Not only that, but I was dumped when \NI was never engaged to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.73,0:04:46.25,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,What a disgrace.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.25,0:04:50.77,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I've become a terrible and honorless \Nlady. The worst of the worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.77,0:04:53.75,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,I don't think people would go that far.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.75,0:04:55.94,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Oh, no. I spoke my mind again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.94,0:04:59.58,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,I'm sure Prince Renato \Nwill correct the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.58,0:05:02.37,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,I plan to clear up any confusion as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.37,0:05:03.45,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.45,0:05:06.16,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Seriously, that stupid prince \Nruined everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.16,0:05:09.21,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,The next time I see him, \NI'm going to beat him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.28,0:05:09.20,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(659,1)\move(595,65,365,45,1,659)\an1\c&HA26147&\3c&HF1DABC&\shad0}All women look the same to me
Dialogue: 1,0:05:04.65,0:05:07.95,top,RENATO,0,0,0,,All women look the same to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.21,0:05:10.54,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.54,0:05:12.23,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.93,0:05:18.49,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,But compared to Prince Renato, \NPrince Placido is a nice person.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.14,0:05:23.18,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,He talked to me before \Nwhen I was all by myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.18,0:05:27.47,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,and he apologized profusely today \Neven though he wasn't at fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.47,0:05:28.84,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.84,0:05:32.02,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,You and Prince Placido are close, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.02,0:05:38.65,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,It's more that we're childhood friends \Nwho have known each other for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.65,0:05:43.68,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Really? I think you two \Nwould make a great couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.40,0:05:53.21,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,Does Aida have feelings \Nfor Prince Placido?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.21,0:05:55.76,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,Wait. That would mean the shit prince—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.76,0:06:00.80,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,I mean, Prince Renato calling off \Ntheir engagement is a good thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.20,0:06:05.18,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,But won't that harm Aida's reputation?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.18,0:06:07.91,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,But if they call off their engagement \Nbeing called off, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.91,0:06:11.08,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,Uh, she be engaged \Nto Prince Renato, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.67,0:06:16.72,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Forget it. I'm going to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.12,0:06:18.70,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.00,0:06:22.74,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.74,0:06:25.32,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,Please wait here a while longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.32,0:06:29.76,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,Prince Renato should arrive \Nas soon as he's finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.66,0:06:33.91,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,I can't believe he \Nactually invited me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.91,0:06:37.47,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,Anyway, this is definitely \Na castle drawing room.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.47,0:06:39.42,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,It's as luxurious as a palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.27,0:06:42.77,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,The fragrant butter...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.50,0:06:46.03,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,The refined sweetness of the cream...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.03,0:06:49.23,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,Their private pâtissier \Nmust be top notch, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.08,0:06:54.99,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Forgive me for keeping you \Nwaiting, Lady Annovazzi.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:54.98,0:06:55.98,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\move(205,105,145,60)\fad(101,190)\c&HAF46BD&\3c&H503013&\shad0\bord1.5\t(1,1000,\fs25)}SMILE
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.98,0:06:55.98,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\move(205,105,145,60)\fad(101,190)\c&HAF46BD&\3c&HFFFFFF&\shad0\bord3\t(1,1000,\fs25)}SMILE
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.15,0:06:57.13,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.13,0:06:59.82,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,He remembered my name properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.82,0:07:02.00,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,Most people get it wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.00,0:07:03.56,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Do you mind if I sit?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.56,0:07:05.20,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.20,0:07:09.61,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,Seriously? He's genuinely \Nattempting to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.54,0:07:12.96,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,I'm truly sorry for what I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.96,0:07:16.90,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Placido told me why \Nyou're studying abroad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.90,0:07:22.05,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,I sincerely regret tarnishing \Nyour honor and background.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.05,0:07:26.26,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,If that's how you feel, \Nintroduce me to a promising catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.26,0:07:28.52,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,A promising catch? I'll think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.52,0:07:30.47,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I spoke my mind again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.80,0:07:33.54,main,RENATRO,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it, Lady Annovazzi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.54,0:07:36.23,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.23,0:07:39.06,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Annovazzi isn't easy to pronounce, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.06,0:07:42.94,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,You can call me Maria, or even \NMimi if that would be easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.94,0:07:45.69,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Thank you, Lady Maria.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.23,0:07:51.64,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Lady Aida may have told you already, \Nbut I've been avoiding her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.64,0:07:52.70,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.70,0:07:57.71,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,I've been having Placido escort her \Nwhile I've hardly seen her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.71,0:08:01.91,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,So I didn't even know what \NLady Aida currently looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.91,0:08:05.74,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,But why do you need to avoid her so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.74,0:08:09.59,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I heard you were childhood friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.59,0:08:13.27,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Yes, so I knew her hair color.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.27,0:08:15.60,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,That's why I was certain you were her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.60,0:08:19.51,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Few people have such \Nbeautiful golden hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.51,0:08:20.96,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.00,0:08:26.57,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,But why did you do that \Nin the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.57,0:08:31.39,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,That was a public setting and your \Ngraduation party. A celebration.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.39,0:08:35.70,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,If you're so intelligent, you \Nmust've known what would happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.70,0:08:40.64,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,You may not become crown prince anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.64,0:08:43.20,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Did you not consider that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.67,0:08:49.68,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,I thought everything would go well \Nif I didn't become crown prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.68,0:08:51.05,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.59,0:08:54.81,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Now that you've said that, \Ntell me the details.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.81,0:08:56.54,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I won't tell anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.54,0:08:59.72,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Well, depending on \Nwhat you say, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.19,0:09:02.94,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Oh, sheesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.68,0:09:09.19,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Come on. Whisper it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.19,0:09:13.45,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I'm not from this kingdom, \Nand I'll be gone eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.51,0:09:18.33,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Feel like telling me now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.34,0:09:20.66,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,The truth is...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.66,0:09:23.85,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Placido is in love with Lady Aida.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.85,0:09:25.26,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.79,0:09:30.46,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Wait, does that mean Aida and \NPrince Placido love each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.46,0:09:33.11,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Should I tell Prince Renato?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.11,0:09:37.02,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,No, it's Aida's secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.02,0:09:38.32,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Oh, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.91,0:09:40.62,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Don't tell anyone, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.70,0:09:47.23,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,He's easy to read. He's loved her \Nsince we were children.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.62,0:09:53.55,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,But Lady Aida's father is set on having \Nhis daughter marry the crown prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.22,0:09:55.74,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.74,0:10:01.10,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,So if I don't become crown prince, \Nit will be Placido, the second son.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.10,0:10:04.96,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Then everything will work out \Nnicely, or so I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.96,0:10:08.96,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,What? This guy's actually really nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.96,0:10:12.46,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,But I made a critical error.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.46,0:10:15.63,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,I even dragged someone into this mess \Nwho had nothing to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.63,0:10:19.22,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Your Highness, you want to \Nmake it up to me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.22,0:10:20.81,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.81,0:10:23.31,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Then don't worry about \Nthe promising catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.31,0:10:25.33,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Treat me to a delicious meal instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.33,0:10:27.24,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,What? A delicious meal?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:25.69,0:10:27.81,sign_Verdana,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\fad(226,1)\c&HFCCD52&\3c&H8E5731&\shad0\frz-10.3\move(445,41,455,25)}DUMBFOUNDED...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.69,0:10:27.81,sign_Verdana,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\fad(226,1)\c&HFCCD52&\3c&HFFFFFF&\shad0\frz-10.3\move(445,41,455,25)\bord4}DUMBFOUNDED...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.92,0:10:31.30,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,What did you just think of?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.30,0:10:34.74,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Steaks at Malvar's.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:34.74,0:10:35.99,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H4342EF&\3c&H1B02A6&\shad0\bord1.5\fad(1,220)\pos(465,10)}GLOW
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.74,0:10:35.99,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\an8\an3\c&H4342EF&\3c&HFFFFFF&\shad0\bord4\pos(465,10)\fad(1,220)}GLOW
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.74,0:10:37.13,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Steak! That sounds wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.13,0:10:38.63,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Let's go eat our fill!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.08,0:10:42.70,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,And fix your lack of sleep \Nby the time we get steaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.70,0:10:44.41,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,You have bags under your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.84,0:10:49.39,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,You're right. I'm busy, but I often \Nhave trouble sleeping as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.39,0:10:51.84,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I can fall asleep in three seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.84,0:10:53.85,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,I'm jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.76,0:10:56.55,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Then as a treat...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.39,0:11:00.65,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I'll teach you the Annovazzi \Nfamily counting song.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.56,0:11:02.35,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,One!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.35,0:11:04.56,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Two! Three! Four!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.56,0:11:06.69,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Five! Six! Seven!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.69,0:11:08.98,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Eight! Nine!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.98,0:11:10.09,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Ten!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:12.44,0:11:14.53,sign_ComicSansMS,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\move(330,55,330,50)\c&HCFCACB&\3c&H514849&\shad0\bord1.5\fad(232,566)}DUMBFOUNDED...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.44,0:11:14.53,sign_ComicSansMS,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\move(330,55,330,50)\c&HCFCACB&\3c&HFFFFFF&\shad0\bord4\fad(232,566)}DUMBFOUNDED...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.44,0:11:19.62,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Remember what I just did \Nbefore you go to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.62,0:11:20.62,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.62,0:11:23.26,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Whenever I do it for my baby brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.26,0:11:25.71,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,he laughs and sleeps soundly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.71,0:11:27.84,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I'm sure it'll help you sleep, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.84,0:11:29.00,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Your baby brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.00,0:11:31.79,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Yes. He turns four this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.79,0:11:33.71,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,His name is Teodorico.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.14,0:11:39.68,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Y-You're treating me \Nlike your baby brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.09,0:11:42.43,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Teo likes this, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.43,0:11:43.86,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,And this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.86,0:11:44.70,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,How about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.43,0:11:40.93,sign_Verdana,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\move(530,45,535,40)\fad(50,189)\i1}SWIPE
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.43,0:11:42.93,sign_Verdana,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\move(530,45,535,40)\fad(50,189)\i1}SWIPE
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.85,0:11:44.35,sign_Verdana,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\move(530,45,535,40)\fad(50,189)\i1}SWIPE
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.70,0:11:45.90,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Please, no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.90,0:11:50.04,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,I-I surrender. I'm exhausted \Nfrom laughing so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.04,0:11:52.04,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I'm glad to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.04,0:11:54.99,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Hunger and lack of sleep \Nare enemies of humankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.37,0:11:58.26,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Rest well, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.26,0:11:59.79,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,I'll try.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.80,0:12:07.50,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,I'll think of your face \Nbefore I go to sleep tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.26,0:12:14.66,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Aida was right. He's smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.66,0:12:17.72,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,He watches Prince Placido closely, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.13,0:12:25.02,main,ELEONORA,0,0,0,,That little thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.01,0:12:33.02,sign_Georgia,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&H141824&\3c&HFFFFFF&\shad0\bord3\an1\frz11.98\pos(367,247)}Always a {\c&H8873F3&}Catch!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.04,0:12:35.78,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,This looks good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.78,0:12:38.34,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,No wonder you recommended this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.34,0:12:40.24,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Go ahead and eat your fill.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.24,0:12:43.32,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,All right. Thanks for the meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.62,0:12:46.45,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,So good!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.45,0:12:47.87,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,I'm glad you like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.87,0:12:50.71,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,I don't know what \NI would've done if you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.71,0:12:52.99,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Of course I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.99,0:12:55.46,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Are you sure you're okay \Nwith paying for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.46,0:12:58.12,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I don't mind splitting the bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.12,0:13:02.30,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Let me treat you today. \NI'd like to thank you for the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.30,0:13:03.43,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Thank me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.43,0:13:08.94,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Every time I recall your \Ncounting song, it warms my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.94,0:13:10.94,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,I haven't slept that soundly in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.06,0:13:12.02,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\move(525,100,550,50)\fad(105,105)\c&HA491F8&\3c&H69366C&\shad0\fs25\fsp6\fad}GULP...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.94,0:13:12.02,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.95,0:13:19.95,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,That was delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.95,0:13:23.37,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,And I haven't had a\Nmeal this enjoyable in ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.37,0:13:27.74,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,The investiture ceremony \Nhas been rescheduled, hasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.74,0:13:32.87,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Apparently, though I wouldn't \Nhave minded being disinherited.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.87,0:13:34.08,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.02,0:13:35.90,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.84,0:13:42.16,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Lady Maria, forgive me, \Nbut something's come up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.16,0:13:45.64,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,I can't escort you home, but \NI've arranged for a carriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.64,0:13:49.32,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,That's more than enough. \NWorst case, I could run home.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.14,0:13:55.32,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Oh, this isn't the carriage we arrived in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.30,0:14:04.46,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Should I tell Aida how \NPrince Placido feels?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.46,0:14:07.99,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I feel bad about being \Nthe only one treated to lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.99,0:14:10.78,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,But he did tell me to keep it secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.58,0:14:17.89,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Why is everything so difficult \Nwhen other people are involved?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.45,0:14:19.42,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.42,0:14:23.38,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.56,0:14:31.31,main,SUBORDINATE B,0,0,0,,Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.31,0:14:33.73,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,You don't have to order me around.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.81,0:14:37.47,main,ELEONORA,0,0,0,,You didn't even realize \Nyou'd been kidnapped?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.47,0:14:41.57,main,ELEONORA,0,0,0,,You're quite the dummy, Maria Annobaddie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.57,0:14:46.32,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,It's Annovazzi. \NPrince Renato got it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.32,0:14:50.37,main,ELEONORA,0,0,0,,You're so infuriating. \NInconsiderate and awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.37,0:14:54.92,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,My sisters do often tell me \Nto be more ladylike.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.92,0:14:59.14,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,So, do you have business with me, \NLady Eleonora Casciari?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.14,0:15:04.17,main,ELEONORA,0,0,0,,Yes, obviously. I wouldn't \Napproach you if I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.17,0:15:07.32,main,ELEONORA,0,0,0,,I was about to seduce Prince Renato, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.32,0:15:13.38,main,ELEONORA,0,0,0,,But all he cares about is my father, \Nlike who he met and where he went.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.38,0:15:14.35,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.35,0:15:17.70,main,ELEONORA,0,0,0,,As a result, his bribery were \Nexposed and he was arrested.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.70,0:15:18.90,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Bribery?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.90,0:15:20.82,main,ELEONORA,0,0,0,,That's none of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.82,0:15:22.11,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.11,0:15:27.03,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Prince Renato allowed you to follow \Nhim around because he knew that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.03,0:15:28.81,main,ELEONORA,0,0,0,,Who's following him around?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.81,0:15:32.96,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,He ignored Aida partially \Nfor Prince Placido
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.96,0:15:36.40,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,and partially to glean information \Nfrom the baron's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.40,0:15:39.14,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,He did it for his kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.14,0:15:41.00,main,ELEONORA,0,0,0,,Now you listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.00,0:15:42.89,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,No, you listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.89,0:15:46.42,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Stop scheming and live a decent life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.80,0:15:48.36,main,ELEONORA,0,0,0,,Are you stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.04,0:15:51.18,main,ELEONORA,0,0,0,,You're going to write \Na letter to His Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.18,0:15:51.76,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.76,0:15:53.93,main,ELEONORA,0,0,0,,If you refuse...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.43,0:15:57.88,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Wait, what am I supposed to write?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.88,0:15:59.63,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Should I thank him for the steak?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.63,0:16:00.98,main,ELEONORA,0,0,0,,Isn't it obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.98,0:16:06.57,main,ELEONORA,0,0,0,,Ask him to help Baron Casciari and \Nhis daughter in exchange for your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.57,0:16:07.78,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.78,0:16:10.67,main,ELEONORA,0,0,0,,We're taking you hostage and \Nfleeing across the border.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.67,0:16:12.01,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.01,0:16:14.99,main,ELEONORA,0,0,0,,Then I'll send him one of your fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.99,0:16:16.50,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,That's brutal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.50,0:16:19.87,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,What? Lady Maria hasn't returned yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.87,0:16:24.00,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,No. I thought you might \Nknow where she went.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.00,0:16:27.05,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,After having lunch with her, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.05,0:16:31.47,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,You rushed back because Baron \NCasciari had begun testifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.98,0:16:34.89,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have sent her home alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.89,0:16:37.66,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Please don't blame yourself, \NYour Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.66,0:16:41.48,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,Finding Lady Maria is our top priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.48,0:16:44.54,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Yes, you're both right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.90,0:16:49.12,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Raimondo, prepare a horse. \NI'm going back to Malvar's.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.12,0:16:52.73,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Perhaps someone in the area \Nsaw or heard something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.73,0:16:53.58,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Placido.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.58,0:16:54.89,main,PLATIDO,0,0,0,,Yes, Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.89,0:16:56.67,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Look after Lady Aida.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.64,0:16:58.83,main,PLATIDO,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.13,0:17:07.61,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,My fingers are safe, \Nbut what should I do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.70,0:17:15.06,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I guess I'll have to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.72,0:17:17.02,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\i1\move(340,195,290,160)\fad(106,443)\c&HE67950&\3c&HFFF1D4&\shad0}SNEAK
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.35,0:17:19.64,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\i1\move(430,165,445,105 )\fad(106,443)\c&HE67950&\3c&HFFF1D4&\shad0}SNEAK
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.73,0:17:27.66,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,What happened? Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.23,0:17:30.79,main,DRIVER,0,0,0,,I was suddenly struck on the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.79,0:17:34.07,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Do you remember anything else? \NAnything at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.07,0:17:37.91,main,DRIVER,0,0,0,,I heard the sound of a large carriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.60,0:17:41.45,main,DRIVER,0,0,0,,They said they were heading north.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.45,0:17:42.62,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,North?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.60,0:17:45.79,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,There's only one road loading north.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.79,0:17:48.43,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,If we hurry, we could \Ncatch up to them. Yah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.43,0:17:49.43,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.43,0:17:52.73,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,Drive the carriage! \NWe're going after him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.47,0:17:58.41,main,SUBORDINATE A,0,0,0,,Don't think you can escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.39,0:18:01.10,main,SUBORDINATE C,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.10,0:18:02.10,main,SUBORDINATE A,0,0,0,,She's over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.10,0:18:04.52,main,ELEONORA,0,0,0,,What are you doing? After her!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.52,0:18:05.84,main,SUBORDINATE A,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.36,0:18:16.86,main,SUBORDINATE C,0,0,0,,She's so fast for a lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.70,0:18:20.20,main,SUBORDINATE B,0,0,0,,Have you given up?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.06,0:18:23.66,main,SUBORDINATE A,0,0,0,,You'd better do as we say.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.46,0:18:29.00,main,SUBORDINATE A,0,0,0,,No hard feelings, milady!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.00,0:18:30.51,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,One!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.51,0:18:31.92,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Two!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.46,0:18:33.93,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Three! Four!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.93,0:18:35.95,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Five! Six!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.52,0:18:43.79,main,ELEONORA,0,0,0,,Get her already!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.37,0:18:51.99,italics,MIMI,0,0,0,,The Annovazzi family is \Na renowned family of martial artists.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.99,0:18:52.86,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Seven!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.86,0:18:53.99,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Eight!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.99,0:18:54.82,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Nine!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.82,0:18:59.62,italics,MIMI,0,0,0,,I was raised to be the Annovazzi \Nfamily heir despite being the youngest
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.62,0:19:04.15,italics,MIMI,0,0,0,,because I was the strongest \Nof all my sisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.15,0:19:06.04,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Ten!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.43,0:19:22.68,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Oh, no. I'm so scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.68,0:19:24.08,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.08,0:19:30.19,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,These men suddenly attacked me \Nand then fell down for some reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.19,0:19:33.53,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,You handled yourself quite impressively.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.87,0:19:36.99,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Since when were you watching?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.99,0:19:40.71,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Since you brushed off Eleonora's \Nattempt to stop you and fled.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.71,0:19:43.49,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,You saw everything! It's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.49,0:19:46.63,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,My life as a noblewoman is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.96,0:19:48.55,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,Take them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.55,0:19:49.55,main,SOLDIER,0,0,0,,Come on, stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.04,0:19:54.37,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.37,0:19:55.58,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.58,0:19:56.72,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Any pain?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.72,0:19:58.52,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,No, no pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.52,0:20:00.22,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.21,0:20:04.93,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Um, why am I sitting in your lap?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.93,0:20:08.35,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Eleonora will be investigated \Nby the authorities.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.35,0:20:11.07,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,She was paying bribes as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.07,0:20:12.37,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,You're ignoring me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.78,0:20:20.74,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,That must've been quite the fright. \NYou poor thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.32,0:20:27.87,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,No one's ever said that to me before.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.33,0:20:33.14,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming to my rescue.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.14,0:20:35.29,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,I did what anyone would've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.03,0:20:37.53,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.53,0:20:41.47,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,So, um... could you let me down now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.47,0:20:42.35,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,No.
