Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.76,0:20:48.35,sign_Verdana,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\c&H7B1C41&\3c&HDDDDDE&\shad0\pos(512,78)}STRUGGLE
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.68,0:20:44.40,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.13,0:20:48.35,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,What? Why can't I push you away?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.45,0:20:52.11,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,May I call you Mimi as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.11,0:20:56.11,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,What? Yes, of course, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.11,0:21:00.43,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Do you recall how I told you \Nthinking of your face helped me sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.19,0:21:02.53,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.39,0:21:07.35,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,It's been so long since I've been \Nable to forget the responsibilities
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.35,0:21:11.75,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,of the crown prince, government, \Nand economy to feel so calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.75,0:21:15.92,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,I feel like the fog before \Nmy eyes has been lifted.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.95,0:21:21.14,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,You sound like you've \Nreceived a divine revelation.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.14,0:21:24.37,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Indeed, perhaps I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.59,0:21:26.40,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.56,0:21:30.83,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Marry me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.26,0:21:34.28,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,What?
