Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.99,0:23:07.70,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.70,0:23:10.41,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,I said I'd find you a promising catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.08,0:23:14.41,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,There is no catch more promising \Nthan Prince Renato.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.41,0:23:15.85,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,H-How long have you been there?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.85,0:23:16.66,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,From the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.66,0:23:19.21,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,No, you weren't! You totally weren't!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.21,0:23:19.99,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.99,0:23:20.68,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,No, you weren't!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.68,0:23:21.54,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.54,0:23:22.47,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I didn't see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.47,0:23:23.08,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,I was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.08,0:23:24.37,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,But I didn't see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.01,0:23:30.21,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,My family emphasized a clean plate \Nas much as martial arts,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.21,0:23:34.02,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,so everyone always says, "Wow, when did \Nyou finish your food? It's already gone!"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.02,0:23:37.05,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Do I really eat that fast? \NJust the other day, Aida said...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.05,0:23:39.98,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Oh, I said that out loud again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.02,0:23:40.02,sign_Georgia,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,65)\c&H141722&\bord4\shad0\fs19\3c&HF4F3FC&}Next Time
